# Code owners for the numerical core (#2636).
#
# A failure in these directories is a wrong-but-plausible number, not a crash,
# so review needs someone who knows the oracle rules in AGENTS.md: non-degenerate
# fixtures, measured tolerances, dual-vs-FD parity. Any one listed owner's
# approval satisfies the code-owner review; it is enforced by "Require review
# from Code Owners" on the `main-protection` ruleset.
#
# Everything else is unowned, so any maintainer's approval suffices there.
# `tests/codeowners.rs` fails if a path below stops existing, so a rename cannot
# silently drop ownership.

/src/estimation/ @roninsightrx @TeunP @hiddevandebeek
/src/sens/       @roninsightrx @TeunP @hiddevandebeek
/src/stats/      @roninsightrx @TeunP @hiddevandebeek
/src/pk/         @roninsightrx @TeunP @hiddevandebeek
